# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED: image globs.
#
# Do NOT add `*.png`, `*.jpg`, `*.jpeg`, `*.svg` or similar patterns here.
# The site's real image assets live in public/images/ and MUST stay tracked --
# a blanket image ignore would silently drop them from the deployed build.
# If a screenshot needs to be excluded, ignore it by exact path instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
